FreeType is the font rendering library behind nearly every graphical text stack.
Built with zlib and PNG support (compressed fonts and color bitmap glyphs); HarfBuzz,
bzip2 and brotli are left out for now. Installs the shared library, headers (under
include/freetype2) and freetype2.pc under /usr/local.
upstream: https://freetype.org/
